loss":"they pass by"},{"surface":"மன்னே","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"நாணட்டு","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"நாண்","gloss":"modesty"},{"text":"அட்டு","lemma":"அடு","gloss":"having destroyed"}],"gloss":"having destroyed modesty"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்லறி","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"},{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"knowledge/sense"}],"gloss":"good sense"},{"surface":"விழுந்த","parts":[{"text":"விழுந்த","lemma":"விழுந்த","gloss":"fallen / lost"}],"gloss":"fallen / lost","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"passion"}],"gloss":"passion"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வில்","parts":[{"text":"வில்","lemma":"வில்","gloss":"bow"}],"gloss":"bow"},{"surface":"உமிழ்","parts":[{"text":"உமிழ்","lemma":"உமிழ்","gloss":"spit/release"}],"gloss":"spitting"},{"surface":"கணியின்","parts":[{"text":"கணி","lemma":"கணி","gloss":"bamboo/arrow"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique/locative suffix"}],"gloss":"like an arrow"},{"surface":"சென்று","parts":[{"text":"சென்று","lemma":"சென்று","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சேண்","parts":[{"text":"சேண்","lemma":"சேண்","gloss":"distance"}],"gloss":"distance"},{"surface":"படவே","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"happen/reach"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"to reach"}]}],"literal":"Even if living in one town, he does not come to our street / Even if he comes to our street, he does not embrace me fully / Like the cremation ground of strangers / he passes by without looking, indeed! Having destroyed modesty / passion that has lost good sense / goes and reaches far away like an arrow shot from a bow.","translation":"Even though we live in the same town, he does not come to my street. Even if he comes to my street, he does not embrace me fully. Like a cremation ground of strangers, he passes by without looking at me. Having destroyed my modesty, my passion, which has lost all good sense, has gone and reached far away, like an arrow shot from a bow.","modern":"நாங்கள் ஒரே ஊரில் வாழ்ந்தாலும் அவர் என் தெருவுக்கு வரமாட்டார். தெருவுக்கு வந்தாலும் என்னை முழுமையாகத் தழுவமாட்டார். அயலாரின் சுடுகாட்டைப் போல என்னைப் பார்க்காமலேயே கடந்துபோவார். என் நாணத்தை அழித்து, நல்லறிவை இழக்கச் செய்த என் காமமானது, வில்லிலிருந்து உமிழப்பட்ட அம்பைப் போலச் சென்று தொலைவில் தங்கிவிட்டது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante about the hero's indifference after he starts visiting courtesans. She laments that even though they live in the same town, he avoids her street, and even when he passes by, he ignores her like a stranger avoiding a cremation ground. Meanwhile, her passion for him, having overcome her modesty and good sense, has flown far away to him like a swift arrow shot from a bow. The image of the cremation ground of strangers vividly conveys the utter avoidance and dread with which the hero treats her home. The metaphor of the arrow shot from a bow represents her uncontrollable, swift, and irreversible love that has left her body and mind to dwell with him.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.2],[2.2,2.4],[2.4,2.6],[2.6,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,4.3],[4.3,4.7],[4.7,5.1],[5.1,5.7],[6.33,6.65],[6.65,6.93],[6.93,7.3],[7.3,8.0],[8.0,8.7],[8.7,9.0],[9.0,9.18],[9.53,10.4],[10.4,10.91],[10.91,11.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.5],[2.5,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.54],[3.54,3.8],[3.8,5.0],[5.0,5.6],[5.6,5.9],[5.9,6.69],[6.69,6.95],[6.95,7.4],[7.4,8.0],[8.0,8.75],[8.75,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.05],[10.35,11.1],[11.1,11.83],[11.83,12.1]]},"sync":[[["ஓர்","one"],["ஊர்","town"]],[["வாழினும்","even if living"]],[["சேரி","street"]],[["வாரார்","he does not come"]],[["சேரி","street"]],[["வரினும்","even if coming"]],[["ஆர","fully"]],[["முயங்கார்","he does not embrace"]],[["ஏதிலாளர்","strangers"]],[["ஏதிலாளர்","strangers"]],[["சுடலை","cremation ground"]],[["போல","like"]],[["காணா","without seeing"]],[["கழிப","they pass by"]],[["மன்னே","indeed"]],[["நாணட்டு","having destroyed modesty"]],[["நல்லறி","good sense"]],[["விழுந்த","fallen / lost"]],[["காமம்","passion"]],[["வில்","bow"],["உமிழ்","spitting"]],[["கணியின்","like an arrow"]],[["சென்று","having gone"],["சேண்","distance"]],[["படவே","to reach"]]]}